      "text": "I can see the book is confirmed and well-documented, but I only have metadata so far. Let me try to retrieve the actual relevant passages from the early chapters where Tufte introduces the data-ink ratio and chartjunk.",
      "mediaUrl": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I got a fragment from the opening chapter. Let me now pull the specific chapters where Tufte formally defines the data-ink ratio and chartjunk — these appear in Part II of the book.",
